"The tutorial follows a flow that is similar to the [Simulate 1D Fermi-Hubbard dynamics with flow sets](/addons/qiskit-fermions/guides/1-d-fermi-hubbard) guide,\n"
"but it extends the approach to spinful systems.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tutorial ini mengikuti alur yang mirip dengan panduan [Simulate 1D Fermi-Hubbard dynamics with flow sets](/addons/qiskit-fermions/guides/1-d-fermi-hubbard),\n"
"tetapi memperluas pendekatannya ke sistem berspin.\n"

