#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Learning outcomes {#learning-outcomes}"
msgstr "Hasil pembelajaran {#learning-outcomes}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"After completing this tutorial, you can expect to understand the following information:\n"
"- How the choice between blocked and interleaved ordering of the spin modes changes which fermionic modes interact, and how that\n"
"  choice appears as Pauli patterns after a flow-set fermion-to-qubit encoding.\n"
"- How to build the time-evolution circuit of the spinful Fermi-Hubbard model as a `FermionicCircuit`, and validate it against `ffsim`.\n"
"- How a flow-set synthesis keeps the two-qubit depth of a Trotter step constant as the chain grows, compared with a term-by-term `LieTrotter` synthesis.\n"
"- How to route such circuits onto the heavy-hex lattice of an IBM&reg; Heron QPU and onto the square lattice of a Nighthawk QPU,\n"
"  including the effect of fractional gates.\n"
"- Why the square lattice of Nighthawk favors blocked ordering with two ancillas while a ladder fits on the QPU, and what it\n"
"  costs to fold the ladder for larger systems.\n"
msgstr ""
"Setelah menyelesaikan tutorial ini, kamu diharapkan memahami hal-hal berikut:\n"
"- Bagaimana pilihan antara urutan blocked dan interleaved untuk mode spin mengubah mode fermionik mana yang berinteraksi, dan bagaimana\n"
"  pilihan itu muncul sebagai pola Pauli setelah encoding fermion-ke-qubit flow-set.\n"
"- Cara membangun Circuit evolusi waktu model Fermi-Hubbard berspin sebagai `FermionicCircuit`, dan memvalidasinya terhadap `ffsim`.\n"
"- Bagaimana sintesis flow-set menjaga kedalaman dua-qubit satu langkah Trotter tetap konstan seiring bertambahnya panjang rantai, dibandingkan dengan sintesis `LieTrotter` suku demi suku.\n"
"- Cara merutekan Circuit semacam itu ke kisi heavy-hex QPU IBM&reg; Heron dan ke kisi persegi QPU Nighthawk,\n"
"  termasuk efek Gate fraksional.\n"
"- Mengapa kisi persegi Nighthawk lebih menguntungkan urutan blocked dengan dua ancilla selama sebuah ladder muat di QPU, dan berapa\n"
"  biaya untuk melipat ladder tersebut pada sistem yang lebih besar.\n"

