msgstr "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/spinful-fermi-hubbard-dynamics/extracted-outputs/0c8d3dd9-0.avif)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Routing and the role of the seeds {#routing-and-the-role-of-the-seeds}"
msgstr "Routing dan peran seed {#routing-and-the-role-of-the-seeds}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The metrics for routing are the **two-qubit depth** and the **two-qubit gate count** after the preset pass manager at\n"
"optimization level 3, in a given basis. The default basis in this tutorial is `{cz, rz, sx, x}`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Metrik untuk routing adalah **kedalaman dua-qubit** dan **jumlah Gate dua-qubit** setelah preset pass manager pada\n"
"tingkat optimasi 3, dalam basis tertentu. Basis default dalam tutorial ini adalah `{cz, rz, sx, x}`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"*Which part is random?* The layout is fixed, but the router is not deterministic across seeds. The Qiskit `SabreSwap` pass runs\n"
"several randomized trials (20 at optimization level 3), seeded from the `seed_transpiler` value that you pass, and keeps the trial with\n"
"the fewest SWAP gates. Therefore, a seed fixes the whole set of trials, and a different seed gives a different set. The router has\n"
"work to do on every layout, because of the `ZZ` pairs that the previous section counted. Different seeds find different SWAP gates, and the\n"
"router selects by SWAP count, not by two-qubit depth. For these reasons, the code routes every circuit with 20 seeds and **keeps the best result**: the\n"
"smallest two-qubit depth, with ties going to the smaller gate count. The gate count that this tutorial reports is the count of that same circuit.\n"
msgstr ""
"*Bagian mana yang acak?* Layout-nya tetap, tetapi router tidak deterministik antar seed. Pass `SabreSwap` Qiskit menjalankan\n"
"beberapa percobaan acak (20 pada tingkat optimasi 3), yang di-seed dari nilai `seed_transpiler` yang kamu berikan, dan menyimpan percobaan dengan\n"
"Gate SWAP paling sedikit. Karena itu, satu seed menetapkan seluruh set percobaan, dan seed berbeda menghasilkan set yang berbeda. Router\n"
"selalu punya pekerjaan pada setiap layout, karena pasangan `ZZ` yang dihitung pada bagian sebelumnya. Seed berbeda menemukan Gate SWAP yang berbeda, dan\n"
"router memilih berdasarkan jumlah SWAP, bukan kedalaman dua-qubit. Karena alasan ini, kode merutekan setiap Circuit dengan 20 seed dan **menyimpan hasil terbaik**: kedalaman\n"
"dua-qubit terkecil, dengan seri dimenangkan jumlah Gate yang lebih kecil. Jumlah Gate yang dilaporkan tutorial ini adalah jumlah dari Circuit yang sama itu.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Fractional gates: a second gate set {#fractional-gates-a-second-gate-set}"
msgstr "Gate fraksional: set Gate kedua {#fractional-gates-a-second-gate-set}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"IBM Heron and Nighthawk devices can run `rzz(theta)` for $0 < \\theta \\le \\pi/2$ and `rx(theta)` for any $\\theta$ as native\n"
"gates. These *fractional gates* are experimental and are off by default. On a real backend, you turn them on with\n"
"`QiskitRuntimeService.backend(\"ibm_torino\", use_fractional_gates=True)`. This setting is a *backend* option, not a transpiler flag.\n"
"The returned `Target` contains `rzz` with `angle_bounds=[(0, pi/2)]`, and `rx`, and the transpiler then uses them.\n"
msgstr ""
"Perangkat IBM Heron dan Nighthawk dapat menjalankan `rzz(theta)` untuk $0 < \\theta \\le \\pi/2$ dan `rx(theta)` untuk $\\theta$ apa pun sebagai Gate\n"
"native. *Gate fraksional* ini bersifat eksperimental dan nonaktif secara default. Pada Backend sungguhan, kamu mengaktifkannya dengan\n"
"`QiskitRuntimeService.backend(\"ibm_torino\", use_fractional_gates=True)`. Pengaturan ini adalah opsi *Backend*, bukan flag Transpiler.\n"
"`Target` yang dikembalikan berisi `rzz` dengan `angle_bounds=[(0, pi/2)]`, dan `rx`, lalu Transpiler memakainya.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The code routes every circuit on the QPUs twice: onto the plain `{cz, rz, sx, x}` default basis, and\n"
"onto a fractional target. A two-qubit layer is a layer of `cz` **or** `rzz` gates, and each of these gates counts as one two-qubit gate.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kode ini me-routing setiap sirkuit ke QPU dua kali: ke basis default biasa `{cz, rz, sx, x}`, dan\n"
"ke target fraksional. Satu lapisan dua-qubit adalah lapisan gerbang `cz` **atau** `rzz`, dan setiap gerbang ini dihitung sebagai satu gerbang dua-qubit.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`FakeFez` and `FakeNighthawk` in this environment do not include fractional gates, so the next cell **builds the targets manually**,\n"
"based on the assumptions that are documented in the cell. The depths that later cells report therefore show what the transpiler can do with\n"
"such a gate set. They do not show what a real backend with fractional gates delivers.\n"
msgstr ""
"`FakeFez` dan `FakeNighthawk` di lingkungan ini tidak menyertakan gerbang fraksional, jadi sel berikutnya **membangun target secara manual**,\n"
"berdasarkan asumsi yang didokumentasikan di sel tersebut. Karena itu, kedalaman yang dilaporkan sel-sel berikutnya menunjukkan apa yang bisa dilakukan Transpiler dengan\n"
"set gerbang seperti itu. Angka-angka itu tidak menunjukkan apa yang dihasilkan Backend sungguhan dengan gerbang fraksional.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
