#, no-wrap
msgid "Route onto the QPUs, in both gate sets {#route-onto-the-qpus-in-both-gate-sets}"
msgstr "Routing ke QPU, di kedua set gerbang {#route-onto-the-qpus-in-both-gate-sets}"

