#, no-wrap
msgid "Solid lines are the `{cz, rz, sx, x}` basis, and dashed lines are the fractional gate set. The two gray lines are the plain line.\n"
msgstr "Garis solid adalah basis `{cz, rz, sx, x}`, dan garis putus-putus adalah set gerbang fraksional. Dua garis abu-abu adalah garis biasa.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**The synthesis.** With `LieTrotter`, the depth grows with every site (from 47 at $L = 4$ to 599 at $L = 50$, or 12 layers per site).\n"
"The flow-set synthesis stays between 20 and 25 over the same range. The bands reach from the best to the worst of the 20 seeds.\n"
"The gate count grows linearly for both syntheses, and is lower for the flow-set synthesis (882 compared with 1032 at $L = 50$). Therefore, the lower\n"
"depth does not cost extra gates.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Sintesisnya.** Dengan `LieTrotter`, kedalaman bertambah di setiap situs (dari 47 pada $L = 4$ menjadi 599 pada $L = 50$, atau 12 lapisan per situs).\n"
"Sintesis flow-set tetap di antara 20 dan 25 pada rentang yang sama. Pita-pitanya membentang dari yang terbaik sampai yang terburuk dari 20 seed.\n"
"Jumlah gerbang bertambah secara linear untuk kedua sintesis, dan lebih rendah untuk sintesis flow-set (882 dibandingkan 1032 pada $L = 50$). Jadi, kedalaman\n"
"yang lebih rendah tidak menambah jumlah gerbang.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**The QPUs.** On both QPUs, the flow-set circuit has the same low depth as on the line. The best depth is between 20 and 25 for $L$\n"
"from 4 to 50 on Heron, on Nighthawk, and on the line. The gate counts are also similar. At $L = 10$, the circuit has 164 two-qubit gates on\n"
"Heron, 162 on Nighthawk, and 164 on the line. At $L = 50$, it has 880, 838, and 882. Therefore, **any hardware that has a long\n"
"enough path can run this circuit at an almost constant depth**. The layout is a simple search on Heron, or a snake through\n"
"the rows on Nighthawk.\n"
msgstr ""
"**QPU-nya.** Di kedua QPU, sirkuit flow-set punya kedalaman rendah yang sama seperti di garis. Kedalaman terbaik ada di antara 20 dan 25 untuk $L$\n"
"dari 4 sampai 50 di Heron, di Nighthawk, dan di garis. Jumlah gerbangnya juga mirip. Pada $L = 10$, sirkuit ini punya 164 gerbang dua-qubit di\n"
"Heron, 162 di Nighthawk, dan 164 di garis. Pada $L = 50$, jumlahnya 880, 838, dan 882. Jadi, **perangkat keras apa pun yang punya jalur yang cukup\n"
"panjang bisa menjalankan sirkuit ini dengan kedalaman yang hampir konstan**. Layout-nya berupa pencarian sederhana di Heron, atau jalur ular melewati\n"
"baris-baris di Nighthawk.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Fractional gates.** The fractional gate set lowers the best depth by six layers at every size. On Heron, the depth goes from 20, 20, 23, 23,\n"
"23, 25 to 14, 14, 17, 17, 17, 19. On Nighthawk, it goes from 20, 22, 22, 22, 22, 25 to 14, 16, 16, 16, 16, 19 (at $L = 4, 10, 20, 30,\n"
"40, 50$). This result is expected. The `YY` and `ZZ` flow sets consist of `rzz` rotations, which the fractional gate set runs\n"
"as one gate, while the `cz` basis needs two `cz` gates. These rotations cause the constant drop in depth, and a drop in gate count that\n"
"increases with $L$.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Gerbang fraksional.** Set gerbang fraksional menurunkan kedalaman terbaik sebanyak enam lapisan di setiap ukuran. Di Heron, kedalaman berubah dari 20, 20, 23, 23,\n"
"23, 25 menjadi 14, 14, 17, 17, 17, 19. Di Nighthawk, berubah dari 20, 22, 22, 22, 22, 25 menjadi 14, 16, 16, 16, 16, 19 (pada $L = 4, 10, 20, 30,\n"
"40, 50$). Hasil ini wajar. Flow set `YY` dan `ZZ` terdiri dari rotasi `rzz`, yang dijalankan set gerbang fraksional\n"
"sebagai satu gerbang, sedangkan basis `cz` butuh dua gerbang `cz`. Rotasi-rotasi ini menyebabkan penurunan kedalaman yang konstan, dan penurunan jumlah gerbang yang\n"
"makin besar seiring $L$.\n"

