msgstr "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/spinful-fermi-hubbard-dynamics/extracted-outputs/ba54a995-1.avif)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "6. Scaling beyond the native dimensions of Nighthawk {#6-scaling-beyond-the-native-dimensions-of-nighthawk}"
msgstr "6. Penskalaan melampaui dimensi native Nighthawk {#6-scaling-beyond-the-native-dimensions-of-nighthawk}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For $L$ greater than 11, a chain does not fit in a straight line, so the ladder must **fold**. The `folded_ladder` function cuts each chain into segments, and\n"
"stacks the segments in strips of two adjacent grid lines. Each strip starts at the opposite end from the end of the previous strip.\n"
"Each strip boundary stretches one spin-up link and one spin-down link from distance 1 to distance 2, and this stretch is the only imperfection.\n"
"Rungs stay real couplers everywhere. A ladder cannot bend on a square lattice without that stretch, so fewer strips are\n"
"better. The strips can run along the 12 rows instead of the 10 columns, which needs fewer strips, and `folded_ladder` selects\n"
"the orientation that needs fewer strips (the orientation changes between $L=49$ and $L=50$). In the following drawings, the stretched links are red and dotted.\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk $L$ lebih besar dari 11, rantai tidak muat dalam garis lurus, jadi tangga harus **dilipat**. Fungsi `folded_ladder` memotong setiap rantai menjadi segmen, dan\n"
"menumpuk segmen-segmen itu dalam strip yang terdiri dari dua garis kisi yang berdekatan. Setiap strip dimulai dari ujung yang berlawanan dengan ujung strip sebelumnya.\n"
"Setiap batas strip meregangkan satu tautan spin-up dan satu tautan spin-down dari jarak 1 menjadi jarak 2, dan regangan ini satu-satunya ketidaksempurnaan.\n"
"Anak tangga tetap menjadi coupler sungguhan di mana-mana. Tangga tidak bisa ditekuk di kisi persegi tanpa regangan itu, jadi makin sedikit strip\n"
"makin baik. Strip bisa dijalankan sepanjang 12 baris, bukan 10 kolom, sehingga butuh lebih sedikit strip, dan `folded_ladder` memilih\n"
"orientasi yang butuh lebih sedikit strip (orientasinya berubah antara $L=49$ dan $L=50$). Pada gambar-gambar berikut, tautan yang diregangkan berwarna merah dan putus-putus.\n"

